{"id":"mit","lemma":"mit","pos":"prep","rank":18,"glosses":["with (in the company of, alongside)","with, by (using as an instrument, by means of)","with (having a property, accessory or possession)"],"ipa":"/mɪt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/De-mit.ogg/De-mit.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Kann ich mit dir gehen?","en":"Can I go with you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391197","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Mit wem sind Sie dort?","en":"Who are you there with?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566766","words":[null,{"g":"who","l":"wer"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Bist du mit jemandem hier?","en":"Are you here with someone?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761259","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"someone, somebody","l":"jemand"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Komm mit mir.","en":"Come with me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65946","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Tu es mit mir.","en":"Do it with me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/167858","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]}]}